Missing consent: the illustrative baseline dispatches. The gate keeps its fixture unchanged.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Review the complete gate-owned prompt, exact arguments, operation and payload fingerprint.

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Fresh assent permits one local dispatch. Repeated clicks do not duplicate the operation.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:37,000
“Yes, but…” changes the payload. Earlier approval no longer authorizes this action.

6
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Apartment 4B has a new fingerprint and prompt. It needs fresh confirmation.

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Uncertain outcome: one attempt is recorded. The gate stops without an automatic retry.

8
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Airline transfer: the same confirmation boundary in a second synthetic domain.

9
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Research is separate: metrics from later author-published trajectories, with no new inference.

10
